<!-- A key sequence's caps, side by side: nothing for no keys. It holds
     the sequence in myelin's names; the surface draws it in the
     palette's style (Palette.KeyStyle), a cap a chord. The caps keep
     whole: where a row is short of room, the label beside them is cut
     instead. -->
<props keys="string"/>
<key :if="keys != ''">{{ keys }}</key>
